# Majestic

> Majestic is a leading platform specializing in link intelligence and backlink analysis. We provide the world's largest commercial link map with comprehensive data on backlinks, referring domains, and website authority metrics. Our tools empower SEO professionals, digital marketers, and domain traders with actionable insights to improve search engine rankings and develop winning link-building strategies.

Majestic was founded in 2004 as an open-source web mapping project by Alex Chudnovsky. Over the past two decades, we 
have evolved into the industry's best backlink checker, the most trusted source for link intelligence and backlink 
data. Our proprietary Flow Metrics, - Trust Flow, Citation Flow and Topical Trust Flow, offer unparalleled insights 
into link quality and website authority. Majestic serves thousands of SEO professionals and Digital Marketers worldwide 
with backlink data, refreshed daily in a recent index and historic data since 2006.

