## Frequently Asked Questions

**Q: What is Trust Flow and Citation Flow?**

A: Trust Flow measures the quality of backlinks by analyzing trustworthiness, while Citation Flow measures the quantity of links. Together they provide a complete picture of website authority and link profile health.

**Q: Do you offer a free account?**

A: Yes, we offer a free tier with limited usage allowances. This gives you access to key features and metrics so you can try Majestic before upgrading to a paid plan.

**Q: How often is your index updated?**

A: Our Fresh Index updates daily with approximately 6 billion URLs crawled. Our Historic Index contains data seen since 2006.

**Q: What payment methods do you accept?**

A: We accept major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), PayPal, and bank transfers for annual plans. Bank transfers are available for Pro level accounts and above.

**Q: Is there a money-back guarantee?**

A: Yes, Lite and Pro plans include a 7-day money-back guarantee for new customers purchasing their first subscription.

**Q: Can I integrate Majestic with other tools?**

A: Yes, Majestic integrates with Google Search Console, Google Sheets, and other popular marketing tools. API access is also available for custom integrations.

**Q: How many languages does Majestic support?**

A: Majestic is available in 10 languages including English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Japanese, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese, and Chinese.

**Q: Is Majestic suitable for small businesses?**

A: Yes, our Lite plan starting at $49.99/month is designed for individuals and small teams looking to improve their SEO and link-building strategies.

**Q: Can I analyze multiple websites?**

A: Yes, use our Site Comparator to compare up to 10 websites simultaneously, or Bulk Backlink Checker to analyze thousands of URLs in one go.

**Q: How do I track my competitor's backlinks?**

A: Use Clique Hunter to discover your competitors' best backlinks that don't link to you, giving you actionable link-building opportunities.

